  "title": "OpenVerify \u2014 Developer",
  "uid": "openverify-developer",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Plugin internals: cache, single-flight, queue, verify RTT, failure reasons. Delay outcomes include queue_timeout/queue_full (FIFO reject \u2260 verify_failure)."
